-- PipePairFlipTSs — the TxSubmission SERVER (requester) per-peer bisim of
-- the FourNode node-side pipeline milestone (M1, Part 14).
--
-- `TSserverA l hi ≈DR tsServerSpec l hi`, ∀ (l : Link).  Fresh-authors the
-- DRFromRel template validated on the KA/BF/CS servers onto TxSubmission's
-- requester FSM (6 source states → 10 spec positions).  The home offers
-- (init wire-recv + the three api pull requests) are NON value-gated; the
-- wire-sends value-gate the Payload via `≟-diagP`.  The l-generalisation is
-- the 4-way `l` Fin enumeration with Fin transposition in fwdE, literal gate
-- in bwdE.
--
-- No postulates, holes, or `NON_TERMINATING`.  Script-generated
-- (`.superpowers/sdd/gen-ts-server-flip.py`; only the Agda is committed).
------------------------------------------------------------------------

